### ---------- Auth ----------

### Log in as admin (stores adminToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{adminEmail}}", "password": "{{adminPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Register a customer (409 if it already exists - that's fine)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Demo Customer", "email": "{{customerEmail}}", "password": "{{customerPassword}}"}

### Log in as customer (stores customerToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email": "{{customerEmail}}", "password": "{{customerPassword}}"}

> {% client.global.set("customerToken", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Who am I
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

### ---------- Admin: build the catalogue ----------

### Create city (stores cityId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Pune", "state": "Maharashtra"}

> {% client.global.set("cityId", response.body.id); %}

### Create theater in that city (stores theaterId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/theaters
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"cityId": {{cityId}}, "name": "Riverside Cinemas", "address": "Koregaon Park"}

> {% client.global.set("theaterId", response.body.id); %}

### Create screen (stores screenId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/theaters/{{theaterId}}/screens
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Audi 1"}

> {% client.global.set("screenId", response.body.id); %}

### Set the seat layout: 8 regular rows x 12 + 2 premium rows x 10 = 116 seats
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/screens/{{screenId}}/layout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sections": [
    {"rows": "A-H", "seatsPerRow": 12, "seatType": "REGULAR"},
    {"rows": "I-J", "seatsPerRow": 10, "seatType": "PREMIUM"}
  ]
}

### View the layout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/screens/{{screenId}}/layout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create movie (stores movieId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/movies
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Oppenheimer",
  "description": "The story of the atomic bomb.",
  "language": "English",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "durationMinutes": 180,
  "certificate": "UA",
  "releaseDate": "2023-07-21"
}

> {% client.global.set("movieId", response.body.id); %}

### Schedule a show (set showStartTime in http-client.env.json to a future time; stores showId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/shows
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "movieId": {{movieId}},
  "screenId": {{screenId}},
  "startTime": "{{showStartTime}}",
  "prices": {"REGULAR": 200.00, "PREMIUM": 350.00}
}

> {% client.global.set("showId", response.body.id); %}

### Change the show's prices
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/shows/{{showId}}/prices
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"prices": {"REGULAR": 220.00, "PREMIUM": 380.00}}

### Customer tries an admin API -> 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/cities
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name": "Nagpur", "state": "Maharashtra"}

### ---------- Public browsing (no token) ----------

### List cities
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities

### Theaters in a city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/cities/{{cityId}}/theaters

### Screens in a theater
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/theaters/{{theaterId}}/screens

### Search movies
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?language=English&sort=releaseDate,desc&page=0&size=10

### One movie
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/{{movieId}}

### Upcoming shows in the city
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows?cityId={{cityId}}

### Shows of the movie on a date
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows?movieId={{movieId}}&date=2026-10-05

### One show
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows/{{showId}}

### Seat map of the show (use showSeatId values when booking)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/shows/{{showId}}/seats
